From c0b4dfc856a775573ccc41c14a63ee5dbf5a0b36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:28:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): show the machine work envelope in the viewport
 (Browser checkbox)

The Browser View door gets "Show work envelope". With a machine mounted it
draws the tool-tip travel volume as an outline at the setup's work origin:
a box for a mill, a cylinder on the spindle axis for a lathe. The figures
are the ones the stroke check reads. A machine without travel draws nothing
and the tooltip names the missing figure. Display state only: no command,
not saved, no effect on posting or checks.

Fixes #1567

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
